Thought:  
First, I will extract and structure the high-level user needs (UN) from the raw requirements. These will cover the main user groups: football fans (primary), app administrators (secondary), and overarching needs (e.g., performance, security). I will then derive functional requirements (FR) from these needs, followed by non-functional requirements (NFR) such as performance, reliability, and security. Next, I will create Agile user stories with BDD acceptance criteria, ensuring traceability between UN, FR/NFR, and US. I will also identify any gaps or ambiguities and provide recommendations. Finally, I will summarize the statistics for all artifacts.

